WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:05.254
[Ambient tones]

00:00:06.463 --> 00:00:11.510
- [Deni Avdija:] When I was 17 and I came to play a game,
I was nervous sometimes.

00:00:11.844 --> 00:00:13.345
Playing against those fans.

00:00:13.345 --> 00:00:15.472
[Cheering]

00:00:15.723 --> 00:00:16.974
Everybody wants you to score.

00:00:16.974 --> 00:00:18.350
- Yalla Maccabi!

00:00:19.185 --> 00:00:21.437
- [Avdija:] Coach is looking at you.

00:00:21.437 --> 00:00:27.067
It's not really comfortable situation for a guy my age.

00:00:27.401 --> 00:00:29.278
But slowly you break through.

00:00:29.278 --> 00:00:39.205
♪♪♪

00:00:39.205 --> 00:00:41.832
My name is Deni Avdija. I am 18 years old.

00:00:41.832 --> 00:00:46.086
I live in Herzliya and play basketball for Maccabi Tel Aviv.

00:00:46.086 --> 00:00:55.095
Maccabi's the best club in Israel, best academy, for you to grow up as a player,
so my family thought that it's the best place for me to go.

00:00:56.430 --> 00:01:03.604
I play with really experienced guys that challenge me
and inspire me to keep working.

00:01:03.604 --> 00:01:06.774
I try to play my best, to help the team win.

00:01:06.774 --> 00:01:11.862
The teammates likes me cuz I'm bringing
the child's spirit into the team.

00:01:11.862 --> 00:01:14.531
- [Sandy Cohen:] Yeah, Deni is definitely the childish one around here.

00:01:14.531 --> 00:01:17.993
You know, he just kinda has that little
brother thing, so, it's nice.

00:01:17.993 --> 00:01:26.085
- I mean, I like to laugh a lot, to smile, to, to have fun.
Maybe I'll do some stupid stuff sometimes, you know?

00:01:26.710 --> 00:01:29.880
My goal is to maximize my potential.

00:01:29.880 --> 00:01:39.932
Veljko really pushes me to be the best player I can. And you need
somebody that can motivate you and show you you are a good player.

00:01:39.932 --> 00:01:45.145
- Establish first contact. That is the most important thing.
You must establish first contact. That's the domination.

00:01:45.145 --> 00:01:48.357
And, uh, you have all the tools—to establish the first contact.

00:01:48.357 --> 00:01:51.652
♪♪♪

00:01:51.652 --> 00:01:57.616
- [Avdija:] I think that I'll need a little bit time
to learn my body and how to play in this level.

00:01:57.616 --> 00:02:03.455
So, you know, every player got his own pace.
And he needs to be patient and keep working hard.

00:02:03.455 --> 00:02:07.459
That's how I think about it. We'll see where I end up.

00:02:07.459 --> 00:02:11.255
- [John DiBartolomeo:] You forget, I mean, Deni—
you see his highlights. You know, he's a top-five pick.

00:02:11.255 --> 00:02:14.591
Uh, but at the end of the day, you have 
to remember he's an 18-year-old kid

00:02:14.591 --> 00:02:17.094
who's getting ready to leave home for the first time.

00:02:17.094 --> 00:02:22.224
You know, he has the, the same worries that, uh, kids have.
And he knows it'll be an adjustment.

00:02:22.224 --> 00:02:27.313
But, you know, once he gets on the court, he kinda turns it on.
And he becomes all that potential that we see he can be.

00:02:27.313 --> 00:02:29.481
♪♪♪

00:02:29.481 --> 00:02:33.569
- [Avdija:] Started playing when I was...seventh grade?

00:02:33.569 --> 00:02:39.908
I missed a lot of things. Maybe I didn't have the
normal childhood. But it was all worth it, you know?

00:02:39.908 --> 00:02:45.497
I'm playing basketball—the game I love. And, and I can take care of my family.

00:02:45.497 --> 00:02:48.959
Really, it's the biggest blessing a guy can get.

00:02:48.959 --> 00:02:52.713
♪♪♪

